  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"hVJn2\" id=\"hVJn2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u765bdd9e\" id=\"u765bdd9e\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">1.图层</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u75aac3c4\" id=\"u75aac3c4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34eff827\" id=\"u34eff827\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">LVGL具有图层概念,从顶层到底层依次是</span><code data-lake-id=\"u471267cd\" id=\"u471267cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0c5d9f28\" id=\"u0c5d9f28\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">sys_layer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubd415e38\" id=\"ubd415e38\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">层、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u35788b3c\" id=\"u35788b3c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb2e9cc6\" id=\"ucb2e9cc6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">top_layer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u44dd11bb\" id=\"u44dd11bb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">层、</span><code data-lake-id=\"uaec2beda\" id=\"uaec2beda\"><span data-lake-id=\"u362e6962\" id=\"u362e6962\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">act_scr</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub2a66ded\" id=\"ub2a66ded\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">层。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1caebf5f\" id=\"u1caebf5f\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1681699873582-898d80dc-f7e1-415e-9ea8-86945fed4c76.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9b7116eb-b86e-435c-8d8c-93c02e1940f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5361d396-bc71-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2244.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A508228%2C%22from%22%3A%22drop%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1791%2C%22originHeight%22%3A778%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5625%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22ACT%20SCR%20TOP_LAYER%20LAYER%20SYS%20CSDN%40%E7%88%B1%E6%B4%8B%E8%91%B1%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A1500.1086%2C%22y%22%3A330.93036%2C%22width%22%3A128.4070999999999%2C%22height%22%3A29.019560000000013%2C%22text%22%3A%22ACT%20SCR%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1474.8826%2C%22y%22%3A504.62256%2C%22width%22%3A167.04950000000008%2C%22height%22%3A38.112139999999954%2C%22text%22%3A%22TOP_LAYER%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1553.4806%2C%22y%22%3A661.9046%2C%22width%22%3A91.2672%2C%22height%22%3A32.860900000000015%2C%22text%22%3A%22LAYER%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1476.5563%2C%22y%22%3A664.7725%2C%22width%22%3A61.22890000000007%2C%22height%22%3A30.56355999999994%2C%22text%22%3A%22SYS%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1673.4026%2C%22y%22%3A752.681%2C%22width%22%3A104.63520000000017%2C%22height%22%3A17.608099999999922%2C%22text%22%3A%22CSDN%40%E7%88%B1%E6%B4%8B%E8%91%B1%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fdde95%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uab6a0a39%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc47fb0a2\" id=\"uc47fb0a2\"><code data-lake-id=\"uee257618\" id=\"uee257618\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe5f4a47\" id=\"ufe5f4a47\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">top_layer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3b12c807\" id=\"u3b12c807\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">层及</span><code data-lake-id=\"u84b5b664\" id=\"u84b5b664\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua5d85013\" id=\"ua5d85013\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">sys_layer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u84f7b99a\" id=\"u84f7b99a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">层用来创建一些随处可见的内容。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5ac19283\" id=\"u5ac19283\"><code data-lake-id=\"u381d0f96\" id=\"u381d0f96\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3dbc5fc4\" id=\"u3dbc5fc4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">top_layer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua543aa4a\" id=\"ua543aa4a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">层可以用来创建菜单栏,弹出窗口等...</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8d3dcd3f\" id=\"u8d3dcd3f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf591a47\" id=\"ucf591a47\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">鼠标光标可以放在所有层的上面以确保它始终可见,也就是放在</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0cc4ebb6\" id=\"u0cc4ebb6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u976f0f5c\" id=\"u976f0f5c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">sys_layer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u789f906b\" id=\"u789f906b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">层。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua2ec215a\" id=\"ua2ec215a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u97fa22c5\" id=\"u97fa22c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">一般都是在</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8288c00c\" id=\"u8288c00c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u26da72bf\" id=\"u26da72bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">act_scr</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9abc072e\" id=\"u9abc072e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">层创建各种控件(widgets),也就是objects对象。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"Y9TFS\" id=\"Y9TFS\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb3727d6\" id=\"ueb3727d6\">2.objects</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u068584b9\" id=\"u068584b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3df7fc47\" id=\"u3df7fc47\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">在LVGL中,用户界面的基本构建块是对象,也称为Widgets。例如Button、Label、Image、List、图表或文本区域。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uce796265\" id=\"uce796265\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0bc11500\" id=\"u0bc11500\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">创建objects对象并显示在</span><code data-lake-id=\"u435472d3\" id=\"u435472d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b5f8d81\" id=\"u7b5f8d81\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">act_scr</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub280f4ff\" id=\"ub280f4ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">层（Active Screen）上:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E7%94%BB%E9%9D%A2%5Cnlv_obj_t*%20screen%20%3D%20lv_scr_act()%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mV8wH%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4b7a0001\" id=\"u4b7a0001\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u19268790\" id=\"u19268790\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">objects基本属性:</span></strong></p><ul list=\"ua8809533\"><li fid=\"u8a062f97\" data-lake-id=\"u025a2486\" id=\"u025a2486\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d243209\" id=\"u6d243209\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">位置：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ued5dffaa\" id=\"ued5dffaa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b96f965\" id=\"u8b96f965\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">void lv_obj_set_pos(lv_obj_t * obj, lv_coord_t x, lv_coord_t y)</span></code></li><li fid=\"u8a062f97\" data-lake-id=\"ue7dba28e\" id=\"ue7dba28e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u979e7c1e\" id=\"u979e7c1e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">尺寸：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2d21b0a0\" id=\"u2d21b0a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d7f8d09\" id=\"u3d7f8d09\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">void lv_obj_set_size(lv_obj_t * obj, lv_coord_t w, lv_coord_t h)</span></code></li><li fid=\"u8a062f97\" data-lake-id=\"u1aa1e5fd\" id=\"u1aa1e5fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u564599cf\" id=\"u564599cf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">align：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u75aff91a\" id=\"u75aff91a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10b3565b\" id=\"u10b3565b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">void lv_obj_align(lv_obj_t * obj, lv_align_t align, lv_coord_t x_ofs, lv_coord_t y_ofs)</span></code></li><li fid=\"u8a062f97\" data-lake-id=\"uc1daa305\" id=\"uc1daa305\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea6147ca\" id=\"uea6147ca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">样式：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u72d696ec\" id=\"u72d696ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u29e85b90\" id=\"u29e85b90\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">void lv_style_init(lv_style_t * style);</span></code></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"YCcVo\" id=\"YCcVo\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80287611\" id=\"u80287611\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">2.1 位置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud01c1028\" id=\"ud01c1028\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79ea65b1\" id=\"u79ea65b1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">objects设置位置的方法如下:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_obj_set_pos(lv_obj_t%20*%20obj%2C%20lv_coord_t%20x%2C%20lv_coord_t%20y)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GTKYY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"uf327971d\" id=\"uf327971d\"><p data-lake-id=\"uaa4e8c38\" id=\"uaa4e8c38\"><span data-lake-id=\"u486a89f7\" id=\"u486a89f7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数1:objects对象</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u12d87b63\" id=\"u12d87b63\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78b9dd0c\" id=\"u78b9dd0c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数2和参数3:坐标x和y</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"uda0f5e49\" id=\"uda0f5e49\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf492944d\" id=\"uf492944d\" class=\"lake-fontsize