等属性。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uff002af6\" id=\"uff002af6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u600cb1df\" id=\"u600cb1df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">创建样式变量:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22static%20lv_style_t%20style%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZfdHC%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4d55b7a4\" id=\"u4d55b7a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72e1d308\" id=\"u72e1d308\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">初始化样式方法:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_style_init(lv_style_t%20*%20style)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eNOew%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u65f8bea9\" id=\"u65f8bea9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf1da76f\" id=\"ubf1da76f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">给objects添加style:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_obj_add_style(lv_obj_t%20*%20obj%2C%20lv_style_t%20*%20style%2C%20lv_style_selector_t%20selector)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pnRiK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"uede4872d\" id=\"uede4872d\"><p data-lake-id=\"ubb568b2c\" id=\"ubb568b2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa8b6609\" id=\"ufa8b6609\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数1:objects对象</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub75307ff\" id=\"ub75307ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb2b29e5\" id=\"ucb2b29e5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数2:style样式</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u19b6face\" id=\"u19b6face\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d298b37\" id=\"u0d298b37\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数3:设置obj的状态或part,这里默认写0即可</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u7d133eb5\" id=\"u7d133eb5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3a9b402\" id=\"ub3a9b402\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">经常设置的样式:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AEobj%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%BD%E5%BA%A6%E5%92%8C%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6%5Cnvoid%20lv_style_set_width(lv_style_t%20*%20style%2C%20lv_coord_t%20value)%3B%5Cnvoid%20lv_style_set_height(lv_style_t%20*%20style%2C%20lv_coord_t%20value)%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AEobj%E7%9A%84x%E5%92%8Cy%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%5Cnvoid%20lv_style_set_x(lv_style_t%20*%20style%2C%20lv_coord_t%20value)%3B%5Cnvoid%20lv_style_set_y(lv_style_t%20*%20style%2C%20lv_coord_t%20value)%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E5%9C%86%E8%A7%92%E5%8D%8A%E5%BE%84%5Cnvoid%20lv_style_set_radius(lv_style_t%20*%20style%2C%20lv_coord_t%20value)%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%B7%A6%E5%8F%B3%E7%9A%84padding%E5%80%BC%5Cnvoid%20lv_style_set_pad_top(lv_style_t%20*%20style%2C%20lv_coord_t%20value)%3B%5Cnvoid%20lv_style_set_pad_bottom(lv_style_t%20*%20style%2C%20lv_coord_t%20value)%5Cnvoid%20lv_style_set_pad_left(lv_style_t%20*%20style%2C%20lv_coord_t%20value